{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745010/extras/A_Quiet_Place_in_the_Sand.png?t=1747843337\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this early look at <strong><i>Dustoria</i></strong>, you\u2019ll start with a small patch of land and a handful of buildings in the middle of a quiet, endless desert.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No enemies. No timers.<br>Just golden light, soft wind, and the simple joy of creating something from nothing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745010/extras/Build_with_Purpose.png?t=1747843337\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Place buildings thoughtfully, each one scores based on its surroundings.<br>Water collectors near moisture, farms close to homes, solar panels in open ground.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Some features, buildings, and systems are not yet included.<br>But the core idea is here; peaceful city-building at your own pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745010/extras/The_World_Grows_With_You.png?t=1747843337\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each level-up gives you a new procedurally generated tile.<br>Choose where to place it and how your little settlement grows.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3745010?t=1747843337","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3745010?t=1747843337","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745010/43198293dfefb8ea5463517fb1726ad51e1ab739/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747843337","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745010/43198293dfefb8ea5463517fb1726ad51e1ab739/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747843337","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745010/extras/A_Quiet_Place_in_the_Sand.png?t=1747843337\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this early look at <strong><i>Dustoria</i></strong>, you\u2019ll start with a small patch of land and a handful of buildings in the middle of a quiet, endless desert.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No enemies. No timers.<br>Just golden light, soft wind, and the simple joy of creating something from nothing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745010/extras/Build_with_Purpose.png?t=1747843337\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Place buildings thoughtfully, each one scores based on its surroundings.<br>Water collectors near moisture, farms close to homes, solar panels in open ground.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Some features, buildings, and systems are not yet included.<br>But the core idea is here; peaceful city-building at your own pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745010/extras/The_World_Grows_With_You.png?t=1747843337\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each level-up gives you a new procedurally generated tile.<br>Choose where to place it and how your little settlement grows.</p>","developers":["Voxel Bytes"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3742110","name":"Dustoria"},"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745010/41ffa1e9b9674575fe4a2ce240bf3d6cd4024da4/header.jpg?t=1747843337","is_free":tru